guide polestar-completionist-alliance/raid-onyxias-lair
title Onyxia's Lair (Completionist)
faction Alliance
category Dungeons
levels 59-60
zone Dustwallow Marsh
pitch Onyxia's Lair, in Dustwallow Marsh. A raid.
why Every Alliance quest of Onyxia's Lair: the chains that lead to it, the pick-ups before the run and the hand-ins after it.

step Getting there
  note The entrance is in Dustwallow Marsh: the arrow leads to it. This is a raid: it needs a raid group.

